fortnite chapter 2 season 4 is upon us  and we're going to dive into the most  important changes players can experience  with the current marvel theme  fortnite has grown infamous for its  outrageous and daring live events  such as breaking the game and deleting  everything in chapter 1 into a black  hole  in fortnight there have been plenty of  events like these usually near the end  of the season to give it a proper  send-off  now most recently we had the device  which set the stage for the splashdown  chapter  by flooding the entire map however the  transition to the marvel season has been  less  grand the lack of an event is curious  but hopefully we'll have a bigger one  involving these characters  in the near future in season 4 which is  officially called  nexus war thor arrives on the fortnite  island and summons several other marvel  characters  wolverine iron man groot storm  and other characters at first the  fortnite and the marvel characters  confront each other but soon they find  out that there's a greater threat  and everyone then teams up to combat the  season's real antagonist  galactus the map itself has not been  dramatically overhauled  but there are plenty of new marvel  themed locations to visit unlocking  over the course of the season you can  explore areas such as doom's domain  and the sentinel graveyard the season  trailer even shows a shield helicarrier  and there will be other areas that have  yet to be specified  i'm still holding out hope for the  avengers tower  a dramatic change compared to past  seasons is that the nexus war will  not be playable on an apple device epic  games released a statement specifying  players on ios and mac os devices will  be left behind on chapter 2 season 3  while everyone else jumps into the  chapter 2 season 4 launch  if you play on an ios device you can  still play fortnite  but you will be stuck on season 3's  13.40 version  if you own an android device you can  play season 4 if you download it from  the epic game store directly  rather than google play the reason for  this is due to some hefty drama between  epic games  and the apple and google app stores as  epic recently tried to undercut the  purchasing of v-bucks  by having players pay them directly  rather than through the app stores  time will tell if ios users will ever  get the chance to play the current build  of fortnite  [Music]  now plenty of weapons have been vaulted  or unvaulted but there are also some  brand new weapons  the most notable weapon in season 4 is  the stark industries energy rifle  found nearby the quinjets that land  around the island you can pick up the  energy rifle by killing one of the  robots around the jets  stark industries also has supply drones  flying around the map  allowing you to acquire various powerful  weapons and even superhero abilities  fortnite's legendary battle pass system  is back with some  absolute mint rewards the weekly  challenge system returns  letting you gain extra xp and rewards  but the new top tier skin that unlocks  at level 100 of the battle pass  is the iron man skin there are also  wolverine theme challenges that you can  chip away at over the course of the  season  similar to how aquaman worked in season  3. now we'll have plenty more features  and weekly guides to help you rank up to  the season 4 battle pass super quick  so be sure to tune in to our gamespot  and gamespot gameplay youtube channels  for all your fortnite updates thanks for  watching  you
 

